docs {
  Shipment CO2e (ISO 14083 / GLEC, well-to-wheel): per leg, tonnes x km x gCO2e/tkm.

  Test journey, 2 tonnes (500 kg + 1500 kg):
  1. Bangkok hub -> Laem Chabang, truck: lane distance 130 km x 2 t x 100 g = 26 kg
  2. Laem Chabang -> Tokyo port, ship: great-circle 4,624 km x 1.15 = 5,317 km x 2 t x 15 g = 159.5 kg
  3. Tokyo port -> customer, truck: customer has no coordinates yet, so the result is incomplete
     until request 15 adds them (4.2 km x 2 t x 100 g = 0.84 kg).
}
